# Items (validation 1): pick 5 banished cards to shuffle into the deck. Cancelling the pick changes
# nothing, is reported as cancel and uses nothing up; picking 5 succeeds and uses the item up.
# An Extra Deck monster counts and goes back to the Extra Deck (decided 2026-10-07).
start_draw 0 0
start_draw 1 0
item 0 990000301            # 回收之鈴: banished -> deck, 5 cards
card 0 removed 15025844 x5
card 0 removed 45231177     # Flame Swordsman (Fusion)
card 0 deck 91152256 x5
card 1 deck 15025844 x10

0 idle activate 990000301
0 select                    # cancel the pick
expect item 990000301 cancel
expect count 0 removed 6
expect count 0 deck 5
expect uses 990000301 1
0 idle activate 990000301
0 select 45231177 15025844 15025844 15025844 15025844
expect item 990000301 success
expect count 0 removed 1
expect count 0 deck 9
expect count 0 extra 1
expect uses 990000301 0
0 idle end
stop
